FD3"}, {"file_name": "1_V2.png", "id": "1180467559753573", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974844_1180467563086906_1588071258005231872_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vf81gY_TjQkQ7kNvwFmjz_5&_nc_oc=AdpBPjRHni0pc1ImkH1IbrwbAs9Fy8tOIwMxwLJ8gzijQW4lARDLVk8z6uUtBCrzdVk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAYekgjjYc_b59Eou-9FroZe2wqcmlJAznndZJ4JPFzhg&oe=6A5A1ACE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TRAILER COVER.png", "id": "459143080084620", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_459143083417953_4317925573810879115_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=epwlCsC2Ds8Q7kNvwFuYGND&_nc_oc=AdqNRzzwFTSKR2qjNycqjD-bJ-GngcFmNO3UwbqsO8RCcA2QLyc1dRJ5VQ7HV2bCpW4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAk6z9df2rdW2GDBko5TBFPnhOciS_KQobQ7No6aNkXZw&oe=6A5A45DA"}, "display_name": "Lifestory - App", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Lifestory: Explore Your Timelines in VR**\n\nStep into the Timeline Room and immerse yourself in the world of your memories with Lifestory. Experience your life's most precious moments in a virtual reality museum.\n\n**Features:**\n- **Timeline Room:** Navigate through a beautifully designed VR space where all your timelines are displayed. \n- **View Moments:** Relive your photos, and writings in an immersive environment. Each timeline is a gallery of your life's unique moments.\n- **VR Museum:** See your life\u2019s story unfold in a virtual reality museum. Every moment is a piece of art, brought to life in VR.\n\nBecause every moment of life is unique, Lifestory lets you etch them forever on secure timelines and experience them in a whole new way.", "short_description": "Step into the Timeline Room and immerse yourself in your life's moments with Lifestory on Meta Quest. Navigate through a virtual reality museum where your timelines and memories come to life."}]}, "developer_nam